# Rotary + QK-norm: one block of 878 instructions, no branches, run once
# by each of the 128 threads; flops exact, 432 f32 per thread, masked
# loads and stores bounded, at most 256 B loaded and 128 B stored per
# thread. Nothing unknown.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/gluon/rope_norm_kernel.sm_89.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
RUN: %ptxroof analyze --annotate %fixtures/gluon/rope_norm_kernel.sm_89.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
CHECK: $L__func_begin0  gluon_rope_norm.py:18-42     878  (end)
CHECK: unknowns: none
CHECK: coverage: instructions_classified 100.0% (878/878)
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry rope_norm_kernel( // block 128×1×1 | per CTA: flops f32 55,296; sfu flops f32 1,024; global load <= 32,768 B, store <= 16,384 B; param load 6,656 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__func_begin0: // warp * × lane * | exec 128/CTA{{$}}
